  "title": "Is there a way to make Zotero work with my Newsblur stories?",
  "summary": "Hey Samuel! Do you think it’s possible for Newsblur to allow Zotero to grab citations, too? It would be super-helpful for my graduate research if I could use the Zotero button on my browser to record the publication details of the Newsblur articles I’m reading, rather than having to click through to the original link. Let me know what you think!",
